Harmonica sound samples
-----------------------

The audio files in src/audio/samples/harmonica/*.mp3 are harmonica notes from
the FluidR3_GM soundfont (Frank Wen), as rendered to mp3 by Benjamin Gleitzman's
midi-js-soundfonts (https://github.com/gleitz/midi-js-soundfonts), licensed
under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC BY 3.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). They are not covered by the MIT
License.

